  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung looks at his sons and then at Pear Blossom.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) The second son returns home.",
  "[action] (to the second son) The second son follows his father with a sullen face.",
  "[silence] Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "[says] The eldest son responds with resentment.",
  "[action] The eldest son answers with resentment.",
  "the second son (to the eldest son): \"Well, and it is not I who am taking the land and the houses and the money. If I could have the land and the houses I would have them, but you see I have not.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and what is your son to do?\"",
  "[action] The eldest son enters with a beautiful woman.",
  "the eldest son (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Well, and I will do what I please and my wife will do as I say,\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and it is a good thing. I will do what I please and my wife will do as I say,\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung stares and rubs his face.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"What is your pleasure?\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and what is your pleasure?\"",
  "[says] The eldest son responds with resentment.",
  "the eldest son (to the second son, Wang Lung): \"Well, and it is a pleasure to have a man's pleasure and to be able to do what I please and to have a woman in my house who is fit for a man of my standing and my wealth. I say it is a pleasure to have a man's pleasure and to be able to do what I please and to have a woman in my house who is fit for a man of my standing and my wealth.\"",
  "[says] Wang Lung asks his son to explain his pleasure.",
  "[action] The eldest son looks at his wife with pride.",
  "[action] The eldest son turns his head towards the door.",
  "[says] The eldest son responds proudly."
